    },
    {
        "text": "...The sounds of fighting are quieting down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we can't afford to rest yet, Carol. Sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine... But, Mister Bob... what about him...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He might need some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Need some time...? Are you saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oww!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Carol! Are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I just tripped over this root...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, take my hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you walk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can only get in through the cave entrance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. Well, in that case...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
