    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah?! Was that an explosion going off in the distance...? Th-that can't be good...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen closely, there's the sound of screaming as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone's fighting. It's not over yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Carol, are you scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes, I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in order to protect my village and return peace to these lands... I have to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're really brave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Anyway, let's keep moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
